<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87969" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προμανθάνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>learn beforehand,</i> and (aor.) <i>know
				beforehand,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄγνωμον τὸ μὴ προμαθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>O.</u>
					8.60
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				785
			</span></i> (= <i><span class="en">
				<u>Trag.Adesp.</u>
				241
			</span></i>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὔτε π. οὐδὲν οὔτ᾽ ἐπιμαθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.138
				</span></i>
			: c. acc., <i>learn gradually</i> or <i>by rote,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄθλους προμαθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					912.10
				</span></i>
			 (anap.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾆσμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Nu.</u>
					966
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαθήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					643c
				</span></i>
			: c. gen., dub. in <i><span class="en">
				Call.
			</span></i><i>Fr.anon.</i><i><span class="en">
				205
			</span></i>: c. inf., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκῃ
				προὔμαθον στέργειν τάδε </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κακά</span> Sch.) <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				538
			</span></i>.</div>
